*.keystore

# Build outputs and scratch artifacts — 25 MB of them were tracked (F-063).
#
# download/Ciyoto.apk was a committed build output (note the misspelling, which
# is its own argument: nobody was looking at it). tmp/pdf-spec/ was 20 PNGs from
# a one-off visual check. Neither is source, both are regenerable, and a binary
# in git is a binary in every clone forever — git stores it whole, so a 23 MB APK
# costs 23 MB on every fetch even after deletion.
#
# Untracked, not deleted: the files stay on disk, and git history still has them.
/download/
/tmp/
*.apk
*.aab
